(4. Consensus) Tj
T*
(Raft separates leader election, log replication and safety. A candidate) Tj
T*
(wins an election with a majority of votes; each log entry carries a term) Tj
T*
(number and an index. The commit rule only advances the commit index once a) Tj
T*
(majority has replicated the entry from the current term.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Idempotency and Retries) Tj
T*
(Every retried request must carry an idempotency key so that a duplicated) Tj
T*
(delivery cannot apply the same effect twice. Exponential backoff with) Tj
T*
(jitter avoids synchronised retry storms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
